90	\N	\N	\N	\N	[Conditions Générales | Formule CONFORT | Article 3 – Adhésion et bénéficiaires]\n\nArticle 3 – Adhésion et bénéficiaires\nPeuvent être affiliés : le conjoint et les enfants à charge jusqu'à 21 ans, ou jusqu'à 25 ans s'ils poursuivent des études\njustifiées. Chaque bénéficiaire ne peut être affilié qu'à un seul contrat géré par PrediCare TPA. Toute fausse déclaration\nentraîne la radiation et le remboursement des sommes indûment perçues.\nL'adhésion d'un bénéficiaire prend effet au plus tôt à la date d'effet de la police souscrite par l'employeur.	[-0.43220988,-0.055557024,-0.6140868,-0.041335706,-0.82591033,-1.2924112,0.73086864,-0.23741487,1.3118652,0.9790383,-0.03184509,-0.120312855,-0.973288,-0.6107994,-0.1795864,0.49508452,-0.71251225,-1.2795887,-0.036429144,0.08010687,-0.26057562,0.300248,-1.1808318,0.738408,0.82224005,-0.9114734,-0.35948262,-0.119966604,-0.43634862,1.3224874,-1.0166478,-1.5465928,-0.37268716,-1.0208689,1.926109,-0.30833775,-0.11905228,-0.7152486,-1.2976031,0.1855857,0.5349626,-1.761947,-0.25649726,-0.13881107,0.5576557,-0.5229952,-0.6286484,-0.73546225,-0.18782452,-0.9432127,0.92617685,0.61301464,1.0314854,-1.7434561,-0.76682246,0.6745485,-0.7630769,-1.2346672,-1.4910928,0.120853,-0.44564754,0.6545685,-0.6644571,-1.5148394,0.07730801,0.20812558,0.42938825,-0.8066884,0.22747578,-0.4890378,0.30196357,-0.26056087,-0.1822311,0.33105898,-2.2382734,0.46255377,0.99868107,1.0818974,-0.38595068,-0.09500559,0.2537926,-0.10813843,-0.15351972,0.070107974,-0.2691481,0.4406954,0.22815514,0.7195397,-0.40818408,0.64552873,-0.475072,1.0025551,-0.01665796,0.9144718,-0.9010974,-0.42385247,-0.8040983,-0.22486751,0.92536175,0.9364219,-0.71742284,-0.21253042,0.52158403,-0.40227005,-0.5005417,-0.6875275,0.42696136,0.7514424,0.15460013,-0.11099941,-0.58978033,-1.3440378,0.12917238,-0.5112359,0.1368234,0.62942076,0.5748957,-0.3425092,0.0046319216,-1.1075817,0.7156924,-0.061734565,0.6164496,-0.4159762,-0.4536147,-0.19907674,0.009466212,1.5790124,0.81945