99	\N	\N	\N	\N	[Conditions Générales | Formule CONFORT | Article 12 – Suivi des dossiers et réclamations]\n\nArticle 12 – Suivi des dossiers et réclamations\nLe bénéficiaire suit ses demandes sur le portail ou auprès de l'assistant virtuel. Statuts possibles : EN_COURS, PAYEE,\nREJETEE. Motifs de rejet : PIECE_MANQUANTE_ATTESTATION, ENTENTE_PREALABLE_ABSENTE,\nHORS_PERIODE_COUVERTURE, DELAI_DE_CARENCE, ORDONNANCE_PERIMEE,\nPRODUIT_NON_REMBOURSABLE, PLAFOND_ATTEINT, CONTROLE_MEDICAL.\nUne réclamation peut être déposée dans les 60 jours suivant la décision ; une réponse est apportée sous 15 jours ouvrés.	[-0.5727017,-0.2718609,0.41551688,0.085354015,-0.5235789,-0.8163214,0.25181502,-0.27961603,0.76244277,0.21776126,0.6475246,0.41671205,-0.6617673,0.5268523,-0.8563056,1.8981595,-0.08432415,0.16411051,0.373346,-0.2756375,-0.48500857,0.07650849,0.88659996,-0.98415875,0.4439618,0.22971526,-0.8750828,-0.2584064,0.11228875,1.34382,-0.6342053,-0.24933165,0.7678413,-0.51376176,-0.6522593,-0.55678093,-0.7152919,-1.2185998,-1.0050067,1.591875,-0.627773,-0.993367,0.019356847,-0.77888495,1.0209081,-1.0015881,-1.2789458,0.19153313,-0.121490784,0.034647204,0.18985286,0.7582938,2.3249228,-1.817858,-0.74504155,1.3490199,-0.14508702,-1.1171252,-1.268491,0.748665,-0.81390905,0.2133205,-2.1173944,-1.3896141,-0.033913217,0.56138456,0.36559412,-0.02110157,-0.24645257,-1.0647976,-0.023718547,0.23658681,-1.0433879,-0.08509018,-1.606309,0.3409876,0.7528773,0.6262801,-0.8896916,0.3262167,-0.09443416,0.1840986,0.5717584,-0.36637294,0.008549869,-0.5593003,-0.40818733,1.1688144,0.5513634,0.35621026,1.1515828,0.40977675,-0.48855516,-0.2766376,-0.4229149,0.10559288,-1.3825915,-0.16628693,0.5426251,0.15996653,-0.38677743,0.8707743,0.57114094,-0.44324887,-0.63200253,0.3842139,0.8631974,0.7288212,0.8703983,-0.5485219,-0.753912,-0.11856496,0.61226463,-0.42512983,-0.01271554,0.27773085,0.7052685,-0.040842257,0.27416086,-0.43727702,0.29441622,0.25120765,0.6132031,-0.32206538,-1.2732712,0.33104894,0.1039