114	\N	\N	\N	\N	[Conditions Générales | Formule ESSENTIEL | Article 13 – Protection des données personnelles]\n\nArticle 13 – Protection des données personnelles\nLes données de santé sont traitées pour la seule gestion du contrat, conformément à la loi malgache n° 2014-038 relative à la\nprotection des données à caractère personnel et, pour les traitements concernés, au RGPD. Les identités sont conservées\nséparément des données de soins, qui ne sont exploitées que sous forme pseudonymisée. Le bénéficiaire dispose d'un droit\nd'accès, de rectification et d'opposition.	[-0.26137072,0.14941996,-1.4342232,-0.11424943,-1.1470209,-1.5696052,1.6792203,-0.33318862,-0.0312683,-0.0027871802,-0.5660154,0.28135702,-0.9460077,-0.3404667,0.08333059,0.116602376,0.2802337,-0.54417497,0.08059305,-0.22715169,0.2907048,0.96659905,-0.45016423,-0.39822555,0.03397902,0.40766057,-0.14066839,0.07911518,0.25462544,0.40386727,-0.34261626,0.09669934,0.07984932,-0.30717716,-0.19271286,0.5820919,-0.988907,-1.0597855,-1.0862099,0.74868494,0.9337246,-0.4638919,0.6182916,-0.29658416,0.3254556,-0.2908354,-0.07529823,-0.69472444,-0.6722426,-1.0843501,0.40149125,0.68716955,1.2753929,-1.5343198,0.58706355,1.7580817,0.43058392,-1.2876455,-0.038264588,0.32464594,-0.16213569,0.7402556,-1.2043434,-1.8959204,1.1037539,0.85190636,1.1385149,0.16070428,0.18391311,-0.40114284,0.0095053315,0.5735032,-0.5400343,-0.35198274,-1.4097624,-0.25278664,0.42506135,0.9607708,-0.8379086,-0.96253514,-0.111490734,0.43736646,0.5029285,-0.60102946,-0.09436531,0.23024821,-0.19139127,1.1827674,1.2613996,0.055324093,0.20749256,-0.7351611,0.40309462,-0.50514656,0.019583981,-0.45498112,-0.36720708,0.30138618,0.8641879,1.359388,0.7532037,-0.18863265,0.7210164,-0.8303209,-0.20695202,0.8828095,1.8021687,0.98367906,-0.090207726,-0.6663109,-0.14580892,0.28143653,0.9201032,0.48230216,0.17250462,0.06064324,-0.068098605,-0.14137575,0.037621744,-0.6990678,-0.1477523,0.36041272,-1.3152523,-0.47183353,-0.15479767,0.6262372,0.6138763,0.1001