125	\N	\N	\N	\N	[Conditions Générales | Formule PREMIUM | Article 10 – Exclusions]\n\nArticle 10 – Exclusions\n(cid:127) Fortifiants, compléments alimentaires, produits cosmétiques et dermo-cosmétiques.\n(cid:127) Soins à visée esthétique, cures thermales et de remise en forme.\n(cid:127) Actes et médicaments délivrés sans ordonnance lorsque celle-ci est exigée, ou sur ordonnance périmée.\n(cid:127) Soins réalisés en tiers payant auprès d'un prestataire non conventionné ou déconventionné.\n(cid:127) Soins réalisés avant la date d'adhésion, après la radiation, ou pendant un délai de carence.\n(cid:127) Frais engagés sans attestation de prise en charge ou sans entente préalable lorsque celles-ci sont exigées.\n(cid:127) Conséquences de la pratique de sports à titre professionnel, d'émeutes ou de faits de guerre.	[-0.43043265,0.3131141,-1.1104257,0.07432388,-0.76394147,-2.4233127,0.48456526,1.2118955,0.35963365,0.25431836,0.24093613,-0.19993593,-1.3783377,0.16732186,0.5000125,1.2032219,0.016356647,-0.78108615,-0.6522478,-0.17299575,-1.4196379,0.51595205,-0.083848536,-0.68492126,-0.61748904,0.80840975,-0.95836073,0.064719014,1.1121681,0.41442165,-0.9107323,-1.2315171,0.08794995,-1.0253111,0.7175834,-1.5176902,0.05116456,-1.2524704,-1.4479804,1.7250829,-0.10168031,-0.60402286,0.21128106,-0.6034019,0.5863787,-1.0518827,0.12285747,-0.8409868,0.7475652,-0.941727,0.3910618,-0.25113842,1.273279,-1.9769026,0.052189317,1.2781377,-0.6456359,-0.8742584,-0.6765869,0.081589006,-1.3504045,0.56925297,-0.9205161,0.0075160135,0.24114263,0.38489902,0.08524395,-0.578442,-0.10563159,-1.6443684,-0.39787495,0.41921884,0.8480759,0.4171302,-1.9743918,-0.33290538,0.60983926,0.45749763,0.40069357,-0.1880055,0.23486947,0.8443132,0.002147615,0.029077325,0.44552535,0.22139388,-0.10069222,0.5312643,1.0253487,-0.5262023,0.021748852,0.052767485,0.0844482,-0.63173014,0.10144944,-0.0619731,-0.33413574,-0.37951812,-0.11674874,1.0543191,-0.037400022,0.49874312,1.3422301,-0.5183159,0.6232935,-0.1622017,-0