127	\N	\N	\N	\N	[Conditions Générales | Formule PREMIUM | Article 12 – Suivi des dossiers et réclamations]\n\nArticle 12 – Suivi des dossiers et réclamations\nLe bénéficiaire suit ses demandes sur le portail ou auprès de l'assistant virtuel. Statuts possibles : EN_COURS, PAYEE,\nREJETEE. Motifs de rejet : PIECE_MANQUANTE_ATTESTATION, ENTENTE_PREALABLE_ABSENTE,\nHORS_PERIODE_COUVERTURE, DELAI_DE_CARENCE, ORDONNANCE_PERIMEE,\nPRODUIT_NON_REMBOURSABLE, PLAFOND_ATTEINT, CONTROLE_MEDICAL.\nUne réclamation peut être déposée dans les 60 jours suivant la décision ; une réponse est apportée sous 15 jours ouvrés.	[-0.7828577,-0.1989636,0.63295084,0.062900014,-0.45965928,-0.7837943,0.16826716,0.10031101,0.57636684,0.31911355,0.6280129,0.39181587,-0.7189013,0.72109604,-0.8652845,1.9934413,0.053043365,0.24902448,0.46493876,-0.13154683,-0.32869178,0.21047722,0.6406196,-1.0756831,0.46199167,0.12490206,-0.6836492,-0.18669683,0.18926013,1.3714651,-0.8549469,-0.34271687,0.60591394,-0.66561204,-0.69402397,-0.61947083,-0.7621109,-1.0988308,-0.9716499,1.6128521,-0.5767585,-0.72948134,0.104386166,-0.7630115,1.0935773,-0.8137989,-1.3776047,0.16776699,-0.18981878,-0.011130108,0.3223393,0.86679345,2.3241217,-1.9239428,-0.9033073,1.4580442,-0.0018575359,-0.8380218,-1.2090573,0.7980965,-0.73124164,0.31913254,-2.2318027,-1.4568752,0.1091753,0.5788717,0.26829088,-0.13677788,-0.19847225,-1.1884395,0.087777026,0.2149888,-1.2548215,0.06138891,-1.7628146,0.3219264,0.94133747,0.3557694,-0.7542778,0.09340668,0.028287515,0.14575918,0.6899479,-0.54742014,-0.17531814,-0.5058068,-0.16245583,1.0209923,0.50723934,0.35553914,1.1943233,0.31665975,-0.6311949,-0.336653,-0.34679252,0.06086921,-1.3117453,-0.14487682,0.8603747,-0.013275402,-0.4853164,0.92387426,0.5517971,-0.48373106,-0.6174055,0.44711846,0.7208374,0.7090655,0.8530999,-0.52792615,-0.8381607,-0.2841909,0.56502354,-0.3012138,-0.1575771,0.16097754,0.5753094,0.109066434,0.2691912,-0.31649432,0.29422885,-0.25487447,0.28859237,-0.6309054,-1.0660852,0.31